spans.s:
Udrāyaṇa,
(1) n. of a disciple of Śākyamuni (= Pali DPPN 〔2〕 Udena?): Mvy 〔1060〕;
(2) another form of Rudrāyaṇa, q.v., a king of Roruka: Divy 〔565.30〕 (prose; mss.); 〔567.20〕 (vs; here Rudr˚ would be metrically impossible; nevertheless the same pāda is repeated 〔570.4〕 with the unmetrical reading Rudr˚!).
